WASMLib has modified some of those files for speed, and added one of its own
(smlib/source/SMLib/inc/WlTools.h). Each modified file says so under its
licence header, each change is marked "WASMLib:" in the code, and smlib/README.md lists
them; `git diff ae7cce2 -- smlib/` shows every change since the unmodified copy.

Only SMLib (smlib/source/SMLib) and SM_API (smlib/source/SM_API) are built; none of
usd-brep's third-party components (OpenUSD, oneTBB, MaterialX, ...) are compiled in.

js/smapi.gen.d.ts carries SM_API's parameter notes, taken from upstream's headers.
